                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tower to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-01-02"><hi rendition="#italic">January 2,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Tower acknowledges the receipt of the Department’s telegrams conveying the
                    answer of Venezuela and relating to Mr. Bowen, which he has communicated to the
                    German Government.)</p>
